                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This review has been edited-\n\n -No save point has recovered my HP/MP ever. Potions must be rationed unless you get a bunch from drops or grind for money to buy more.\n\n-The first area is an eyesore, looking like you need 3-D glasses. I know some virus bad guys are trying to take over the...stuff? But I know MANY gamers would have eyesore issues with that. Thankfully I've only seen it in the first 10 minutes of the game once.\n\n-The menus are see through, making it VERY hard to read text and see what items you have.\n\n-I hate the 'SANIC' meme even more because of this game. Super terribly painful loud music. Tried it three times. Couldn't find any way to not game over from it, even when I collected all 100 rings? You can't even decline playing the minigame when you talk to the NPC.\n\n-HELLO HAVE YOU BEEN BAPTIZED?HELLO HAVE YOU BEEN BAPTIZED?HELLO HAVE YOU BEEN BAPTIZED?HELLO HAVE YOU BEEN BAPTIZED? said ad infinitum at one point with two NPCs following you around and being general pains in my rear, will get very old very fast as well as their text boxes popping up infront of every other text box if they run in to you. I gave up on one of the sidequests because of it being too annoying.\n\n-Had a glitch where I had to reload the game because of dying in the terrible sanic minigame. The 'Exit/Load' menu stayed up and the moment I hit exit I was brought to the main menu of the game.\n\n-The Quest option in the menu does nothing from what I can see. And the only quest anything just says 'DAVA JONAS AND YOURS ITEMS' so I don't know what either of those things are really supposed to do for you.\n\n-I really hate that 'BAD ENGLISH LANGUAGE' is a feature of the game. Sounds to me like someone doesn't want to proofread, and then do so again to get rid of any typos. Either that or they think it's hilarious.\n\n-Music gets quickly repetitive.\n\n\nI could keep going on, but I honestly don't want to. Only pick up this game if you're in love with terrible $#!Tposting type stuff, and only then. I know I got this for free and was trying to find anything good about it, but I just can't.\n\n\nEdit starts here-\n\nI don't believe this developer, if you can call him that, actually cares about the game or in making a decent product. They came out with DLC for a low quality game that's three times the price of the game its self.\n\nThe deceription for this game is bad, but the one for the DLC is even worse.\n\n'but beware of Team Anarcap, they are a bunch of bad people who love to make a bang in whatever place.'\n\nA bunch of bad people who love to make a bang in whatever place.\n\nThis game just gets more and more sh!t posty looking. I don't even think I'd play the whole game if someone paid me.",
